      50.04,
      246.26,
      541.49,
      376.85
    ],
    "text": "Condition of Rain: Showers will occur at times in the sea areas off the coast extending from Chilaw to Matara via Colombo and Galle. Winds: Winds will be south-westerly. Wind speed will be (30-40) kmph. Wind speed can increase up to (60-70) kmph at times in the sea areas off the coast extending from Hambantota to Pottuvil and from Kankasanthurai to Kalpitiya via Mannar. Naval and fishing communities are advised not to venture into these sea areas, until further notice.",
