    "bbox": [
      50.04,
      379.41,
      541.49,
      529.39
    ],
    "text": "Wind speed can increase up to (50-60) kmph at times in the sea areas off the coast extending from Trincomalee to Kankasanthurai via Mullaitivu and Kalpitiya to Hambantota via Colombo, and Galle. The naval and fishing communities who are engaged in fishing and naval activities in the above sea areas are requested to be vigilant in this regard. State of Sea: The sea areas off the coasts extending from Hambantota to Pottuvil and from Kankasanthurai to Kalpitiya via Mannar will be very rough at times. The sea areas off the coasts extending from Trincomalee to Kankasanthurai via Mullaitivu and Kalpitiya to Hambantota via Colombo, and Galle will be rough at times.",
